{"id":"20e3dbe19bf74740","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-weakly-lowfork.md","title":"弱 K 低性","display":"df-weakly-lowfork — 弱 K 低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-weakly-lowfork","aliases":["43-df-weakly-lowfork"],"display":"df-weakly-lowfork — 弱 K 低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.15.7.1, printed p.470 / PDF p.490","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-weakly-lowfork"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-weakly-lowfork</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakly-lowfork — 弱 K 低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.15.7.1, printed p.470 / PDF p.490"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,K^A\">\\(K,K^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>，自然数采用固定可计算编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyLowForK}(A)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists n\\ge m\\,[K(n)\\le K^A(n)+c].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeaklyLowForK}(A)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists n\\ge m\\,[K(n)\\le K^A(n)+c].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>纠正原书该行抽取文本遗漏 oracle 上标的排版问题。弱低性仅在无穷多个整数输入上控制复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$K,K^A$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]，自然数采用固定可计算编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$K,K^A$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]，自然数采用固定可计算编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K,K^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyLowForK}(A)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists n\\ge m\\,[K(n)\\le K^A(n)+c].","display":true}],"bytes":1038,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-weakly-lowfork]] — 弱 K 低性"},{"id":"99ca786df413982b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforomega]]、[[43-df-weakly-lowfork]]。"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848"]}